ary-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-texttransform:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>DipNT, mANP, The College</p><p>of Naturopathic Medicine</p></span></div><div data-rid="3000ce7f-b56f-4553-82c7-5ed3e40b9c2c" class="r-1qi8uqf alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-color:#2A2A2A;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontsize:17px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textalign:center;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontfamily:Quicksand;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-lineheight:125%;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-letterspacing:0px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-texttransform:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-e2bf30c6-7292-47b6-96b1-1bb9a4ff7feb-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>„Selbst meine gesündesten Patientinnen, die regelmäßig Sport treiben, haben mit Menstruationsbeschwerden zu kämpfen. Stress, Nährstoffmangel und hormonelle Schwankungen können eine große Rolle spielen. Monthlies füllt diese Defizite mit wichtigen Nährstoffen aus Magnesium, Brokkolisprossen, Chrom, Zitronenmelisse und entzündungshemmenden Wirkstoffen wie Ingwer und Kurkuma und fördert eine langfristige Unterstützung des Zyklus und des hormonellen Gleichgewichts.“  </p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rd1r2:-trigger-4e941e9b-4b5f-4641-8cc5-dcd7220bf3283" id="radix-:Rd1r2:-content-4e941e9b-4b5f-4641-8cc5-dcd7220bf3283" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="8c49ae2c-a52c-4990-8183-05357a336653" class="r-1rr7ort"><picture data-rid="b9722c45-04e3-49fd-92b5-4c12f4f7e0b1" class="r-kt9gcv"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/1_2_aaa7a350-73cd-4404-ba37-07284d15cb20.webp?v=1737642708&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" alt="A person outdoors holding a stethoscope while smiling." class="r-emnhro" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="a5384187-37c4-49aa-a3f4-cc61136ae9f4" class="r-eozguv"><div data-rid="80f3c398-61e9-415e-9d1e-66ccfbc9f05f" class="r-1j4yq03 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-color:#252a31;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-fontsize:22px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a