ined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-letterspacing:0px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-texttransform:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>DipNT, mANP, The College of Naturopathic Medicine</p></span></div><div data-rid="c9dcc972-e90b-4212-9449-ad0b510c4c3f" class="r-r6q5lz alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-color:#2A2A2A;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-fontsize:14px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-textalign:center;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-fontfamily:Quicksand;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-lineheight:125%;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-letterspacing:0px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-texttransform:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>„Selbst meine gesündesten Patientinnen, die regelmäßig Sport treiben, haben mit Menstruationsbeschwerden zu kämpfen. Stress, Nährstoffmangel und hormonelle Schwankungen können eine große Rolle spielen. Monthlies füllt diese Defizite mit wichtigen Nährstoffen aus Magnesium, Brokkolisprossen, Chrom, Zitronenmelisse und entzündungshemmenden Wirkstoffen wie Ingwer und Kurkuma und fördert eine langfristige Unterstützung des Zyklus und des hormonellen Gleichgewichts.“</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="a9d1ffcb-6aa9-4790-92d2-5a849c849ca2" class="r-1htpoho"><picture data-rid="99ae78d0-eafd-416e-88ca-b107177b6fab" class="r-d3krkm"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/5_2_ca8ae0c2-d553-4252-a355-5b2092680f14.webp?v=1737642707&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/5_2_ca8ae0c2-d553-4252-a355-5b2092680f14.webp?v=1737642707&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/5_2_ca8ae0c2-d553-4252-a355-5b2092680f14.webp?v=1737642707&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/5_2_ca8ae0c2-d553-4252-a355-5b2092680f14.webp?v=1737642707" alt="A person with long blonde hair smiling, wearing a blue top." class="r-151dpww" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="e4cda82f-78c4-4848-b931-6c8ff02fda50" class="r-jdfc76"><div data-rid="8a649459-3e4e-4f76-8d10-4dee2961313d" class="r-16ct8oq alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-color:#252a31;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-fontsize:22px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-fontfamily:Quicksand;--replo-library-72